CommitDate: Tue Nov 24 22:00:36 2026 +0000

    Charge meter commits after stop; never release observed budget liability
    
    finalize_locked snapshotted usage before stopping the agent and committed that
    pre-stop reading, losing tokens flushed to the authoritative meter between the
    snapshot and confirmed termination. reconcile could also close a held overrun
    below the meter observation already on the record.
    
    After termination is verified, re-read and CPU-adjust the pinned session and
    merge pre-stop, post-stop and previously observed snapshots, keeping the
    greater liability. An unreadable post-stop meter or invalid CPU counter holds
    at full cap. Budgets, caps, config, permits, source restrictions and all
    stop/expiry checks are unchanged. Deterministic mock regressions added.

